---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CtaBanner from '../components/CtaBanner.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Modelos de Servicio y Especialistas en WhatsApp | MeowLab"
  description="Conoce los dos modelos de servicio de MeowLab: Agentes de Rol listos para usar en WhatsApp (BillCat, PawsCollect, HunterCat) y Solución Dedicada a medida."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-20">
      <!-- Page Header (no eyebrow pill per #rule-hero-eyebrow-chip) -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-content-main tracking-tight leading-[1.12] text-balance">
          Dos Modelos de Servicio para <span class="text-brand-forest">Operar desde WhatsApp</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-content-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Comienza el mismo día con un especialista preconfigurado para facturación, licitaciones o cobranzas, o integra un asistente dedicado a la base de datos de tu empresa.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Two Service Tiers -->
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
        <!-- Tier 1: Agentes de Rol (Listos para Usar) -->
        <section class="bg-white border border-surface-border rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-9 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-5">
              <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-surface-mint text-brand-forest flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                <!-- TablerIcon: robot -->
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M6 4m0 2a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-8a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2z" />
                  <path d="M12 2v2" />
                  <path d="M9 12v9" />
                  <path d="M15 12v9" />
                  <path d="M5 16l4 -2" />
                  <path d="M15 14l4 2" />
                  <path d="M9 18h6" />
                  <path d="M10 8v.01" />
                  <path d="M14 8v.01" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-title font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-subtle border border-surface-border text-content-main">
                Suscripción Micro-SaaS
              </span>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-content-main">
              Agentes de Rol (Listos para Usar)
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-content-muted mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Especialistas preentrenados para tareas concretas de facturación electrónica, seguimiento de cobranzas, búsqueda de licitaciones o calificación comercial.
            </p>

            <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-content-main">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <!-- TablerIcon: check -->
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Activación rápida vinculando los números autorizados de tu equipo.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Reconocimiento de notas de voz, fotos de pedidos y texto en WhatsApp.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Sin costos de infraestructura propia ni mantenimiento de servidores.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <!-- Flat divider section instead of nested card (#rule-nested-cards) -->
            <div class="border-t border-surface-border pt-5 mt-6 space-y-2">
              <div class="text-xs font-title font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-forest">
                Ideal para
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-content-muted leading-relaxed">
                Negocios y equipos comerciales que buscan resolver facturación, alertas SEACE o recordatorios de pago de inmediato desde el celular.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 mt-4">
            <a
              href="/agentes"
              class="w-full py-3.5 px-5 rounded-xl text-sm font-title font-bold border border-surface-border text-content-main hover:bg-surface-subtle inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors"
            >
              <span>Ver roles disponibles</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12h14" />
                <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Tier 2: Solución Dedicada (A Medida) -->
        <section class="bg-surface-subtle border-2 border-brand-forest rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-9 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-5">
              <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-surface-mint text-brand-forest flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                <!-- TablerIcon: building -->
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M3 21l18 0" />
                  <path d="M9 8l1 0" />
                  <path d="M9 12l1 0" />
                  <path d="M9 16l1 0" />
                  <path d="M14 8l1 0" />
                  <path d="M14 12l1 0" />
                  <path d="M14 16l1 0" />
                  <path d="M5 21v-16a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-title font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-mint text-brand-forest">
                Infraestructura Privada
              </span>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-content-main">
              Solución Dedicada (A Medida)
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-content-muted mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Un asistente exclusivo conectado a tu base de datos PostgreSQL, SQL Server o ERP (SAP, Odoo) con reglas de negocio y permisos por colaborador.
            </p>

            <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-content-main">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Conexión segura a bases de datos privadas y APIs REST internas.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Despliegue en tu propia nube (VPC) o mediante túnel cifrado.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Número de WhatsApp Business exclusivo y soporte de ingeniería directo.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <!-- Flat divider section instead of nested card (#rule-nested-cards) -->
            <div class="border-t border-surface-border pt-5 mt-6 space-y-2">
              <div class="text-xs font-title font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-forest">
                Ideal para
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-content-muted leading-relaxed">
                Empresas con ERP propio, catálogos de miles de ítems o políticas estrictas de privacidad y auditoría de datos.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 mt-4">
            <a
              href="/dedicado"
              class="w-full py-3.5 px-5 rounded-xl text-sm font-title font-bold bg-brand-forest text-white hover:bg-brand-forestDark inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors"
            >
              <span>Explorar Solución Dedicada</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12h14" />
                <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- Featured Micro-SaaS Section: BillCat -->
      <section id="billcat" class="bg-surface-subtle border border-surface-border rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-10">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-5">
            <div class="text-xs font-title font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-forest">
              Especialista en Facturación Electrónica
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-content-main tracking-tight">
              BillCat · Facturación asistida desde WhatsApp
            </h2>
            <p class="text-content-muted text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Envía un audio o mensaje con los datos de la operación. BillCat estructura la venta, verifica el RUC, calcula el IGV y te presenta un resumen claro para confirmar antes de emitir el comprobante.
            </p>

            <div class="border-l-2 border-brand-forest pl-4 py-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-content-main font-mono">
              "Prepara factura a RUC 20609876543 por 2 servicios de consultoría a S/ 850 más IGV."
            </div>

            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-content-main pt-1">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Confirmación obligatoria del borrador antes de emitir cualquier comprobante.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Entrega de archivo PDF y XML directamente en el hilo de conversación.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Soporte para audios de voz, texto libre e imágenes de notas de pedido.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="pt-2">
              <a
                href="/contacto"
                class="bg-brand-forest text-white hover:bg-brand-forestDark px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-title font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors"
              >
                <span>Solicitar acceso a BillCat</span>
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12h14" />
                  <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right Summary Specification (flat divide-y list, no nested dark boxes) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white border border-surface-border rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 mb-3 border-b border-surface-border">
              <div>
                <div class="font-title font-bold text-content-main text-sm">Resumen de Borrador Fiscal</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-content-muted">Verificación previa en WhatsApp</div>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-brand-forest bg-surface-mint px-2.5 py-1 rounded">
                F001-0892
              </span>
            </div>

            <dl class="divide-y divide-surface-border text-xs">
              <div class="py-3 flex justify-between gap-4">
                <dt class="text-content-muted">Adquiriente</dt>
                <dd class="font-semibold text-content-main text-right">SERVICIOS DIGITALES SAC</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="py-3 flex justify-between gap-4">
                <dt class="text-content-muted">RUC</dt>
                <dd class="font-mono text-content-main text-right">20609876543</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="py-3 flex justify-between gap-4">
                <dt class="text-content-muted">Subtotal (2x Consultoría)</dt>
                <dd class="font-mono text-content-main text-right">S/ 1,700.00</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="py-3 flex justify-between gap-4">
                <dt class="text-content-muted">IGV (18%)</dt>
                <dd class="font-mono text-content-main text-right">S/ 306.00</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="py-3 flex justify-between gap-4 font-title font-bold text-sm text-brand-forest">
                <dt>Total a confirmar</dt>
                <dd class="font-mono">S/ 2,006.00</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Additional Specialists: PawsCollect & HunterCat -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <section id="pawscollect" class="bg-white border border-surface-border rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-mint text-brand-forest flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <!-- TablerIcon: credit-card -->
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M3 5m0 3a3 3 0 0 1 3 -3h12a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v8a3 3 0 0 1 -3 3h-12a3 3 0 0 1 -3 -3z" />
                <path d="M3 10l18 0" />
                <path d="M7 15l.01 0" />
                <path d="M11 15l2 0" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-content-main">PawsCollect · Seguimiento de Cobranzas</h3>
            <p class="text-content-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
              Envía recordatorios programados de facturas por vencer, comparte enlaces de pago autorizados y registra confirmaciones para mantener tus cuentas al día.
            </p>
            <ul class="border-t border-surface-border pt-5 mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-content-main">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Mensajes cordiales con el detalle del comprobante pendiente</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Compatible con pasarelas de pago y transferencias bancarias</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Reporte diario de compromisos de pago para tu equipo</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6">
            <a
              href="/contacto"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-title font-bold text-brand-forest hover:text-brand-forestDark transition-colors"
            >
              <span>Consultar por PawsCollect</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12h14" />
                <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="huntercat" class="bg-white border border-surface-border rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-mint text-brand-forest flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <!-- TablerIcon: target -->
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12 12m-1 0a1 1 0 1 0 2 0a1 1 0 1 0 -2 0" />
                <path d="M12 12m-5 0a5 5 0 1 0 10 0a5 5 0 1 0 -10 0" />
                <path d="M12 12m-9 0a9 9 0 1 0 18 0a9 9 0 1 0 -18 0" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-content-main">HunterCat · Calificación Comercial</h3>
            <p class="text-content-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
              Atiende consultas comerciales en segundos, recopila los datos clave del requerimiento y agenda reuniones directamente en el calendario de tus ejecutivos.
            </p>
            <ul class="border-t border-surface-border pt-5 mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-content-main">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Respuesta inmediata a prospectos de campañas y web</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Sincronización con Google Calendar y CRM comercial</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-forest shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 12l5 5l10 -10" />
                </svg>
                <span>Derivación con resumen ejecutivo al vendedor asignado</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6">
            <a
              href="/contacto"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-title font-bold text-brand-forest hover:text-brand-forestDark transition-colors"
            >
              <span>Consultar por HunterCat</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12h14" />
                <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <CtaBanner />
</Layout>
